---
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/layout.css";
import "../styles/components.css";
import "../styles/responsive.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | Convertly</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Read Convertly's privacy policy and learn how your browser data, local conversion history, and exchange-rate requests are handled."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fafafa" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0a" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://convertly.app/privacy-policy" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="legal-page">
      <div class="legal-shell">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to converter</a>
        <article class="legal-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</p>
          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

          <p>Last Updated: October 2026</p>

          <p>
            Convertly is committed to protecting your privacy and the personal information you share
            with us while using our USD to INR converter.
          </p>

          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We may collect the following information when you use our website:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Exchange rate and conversion data used in the browser</li>
            <li>Recent conversion history stored locally in your browser using localStorage</li>
            <li>Browser and device information for technical diagnostics</li>
            <li>General usage data for product improvement</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
          <p>We use the information to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>provide the USD to INR calculator and related features</li>
            <li>improve website performance and stability</li>
            <li>maintain a better user experience</li>
            <li>understand overall traffic and usability patterns</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Local Storage</h2>
          <p>
            Our site may store recent conversion history in your browser using localStorage. This helps
            you view recent conversions without sending that data to a server. You can clear this data
            at any time from your browser settings or by clearing recent conversion history in the app.
          </p>

          <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>
            We use the free Frankfurter API to retrieve exchange-rate data. This service may process
            request data necessary to deliver live exchange-rate values. We do not sell or trade your
            personal information.
          </p>

          <h2>Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            We may use basic cookies or browser storage technologies to enhance site functionality,
            remember your theme preference, or store local history. These are not used for
            advertising or profiling.
          </p>

          <h2>Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            We take reasonable steps to protect user information from unauthorized access, misuse, or
            disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure.
          </p>

          <h2>Your Rights</h2>
          <p>
            You may contact us to request access, correction, or deletion of any personal information
            we may hold. You can also disable browser storage or clear it manually.
          </p>

          <h2>Updates</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any material changes will be
            reflected on this page.
          </p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
            <a href="mailto:support@convertly.app">support@convertly.app</a>.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
